{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-d1-west","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"d1-west-nakheel-mbr-district-1","about":"D1 West - a luxury development that is a collection of 4-6 bedroom villas located along the coastline and 7 bedroom mansions located on a separate island. Each residence has its own private pool. Each villa has a unique design in a modern style. High quality natural materials are used in the finishing, and thanks to panoramic windows all the wall rooms are filled with natural light and creates a cosy atmosphere.Residents have access to a private beach by a picturesque lagoon, a small but cosy park with many places for recreation and jogging and walking paths and a green garden with playgrounds and sports grounds. There are schools, nurseries, shops and a mosque within walking distance.D1 West has a unique location in MBR City. Meydan Racecourse, Meydan Golf, the famous Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary and the Business Bay area are just 5 minutes away. Burj Al Arab, Palm Jumeirah and Dubai International Airport can be reached in 15 minutes.The complex offers a unique resort lifestyle to suit all ages. Surrounded by a lagoon and green spaces, the villas are the perfect place for those seeking comfort and harmony.","price":59890000,"title":"D1 West","bitrix":{"id":438,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"D1 West","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"D1 West","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Nakheel","project_location":"District One"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/289/images/2023/07/12/340x252/O7oSpsuFYcedpaFg2f0nVOnrsZ4VX1XP4vtb9CKT.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/289/images/2023/07/12/464x312/O7oSpsuFYcedpaFg2f0nVOnrsZ4VX1XP4vtb9CKT.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1524209,"lng":55.2770388},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront